###Combine

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}3\blueE{y}-1\blueE{y}+\goldE{6}
\\\\
&=(3-1)\blueE{y}+\goldE{6}
\\\\
&=2\blueE{y}+\goldE{6}
\end{align}$

We cannot combine $2\blueE{y}+\goldE{6}$ since they aren't like terms.
